    "desc": "\n    FixChain AI Algorand Smart Contract Escrow.\n    Provides automated, tamper-proof escrow management for home service bookings:\n    - Funds locking (Service Amount + Commitment Deposit)\n    - Additional work top-up locking\n    - Automated payment releases to Worker & deposit refunds to Customer on completion\n    - Cancellation refunds to Customer\n    - Worker travel/inspection compensation on decline\n    - Frozen escrow during active disputes & Admin dispute resolution\n    ",
